# gv-agent (box-only). Copy to .env on the box (chmod 600) and fill in.

# The os API base. In prod: https://api.drbartender.com
# Must be https; plain http only to localhost or 127.0.0.1, or the agent refuses to start.
API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000
# MUST match GV_AGENT_SECRET on the os server (Render). Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
GV_AGENT_SECRET=

# The signed-in Google Voice profile (mode 700, never in restic). Sign it in by
# hand from a stock Chrome, never Playwright: see README.md.
GV_PROFILE_DIR=/home/drbartender/.gvoice-profile

# --dry-run only: the company 1922 line from server/utils/companyPhone.js, in
# +1 E.164. Never a client's number. If the dry run shows a contact card instead
# of a "Send to" entry, the number is a saved Google contact: use one that is not.
DRY_RUN_PHONE=
